contentText:
Maluma melted hearts on Mother&rsquo;s Day (May 10) by announcing that he and his partner are expecting another child together. He shared the news with a tender black-and-white Instagram photo featuring his girlfriend Susana G&oacute;mez&rsquo;s baby bump, as he and their two-year-old daughter, Paris Londo&ntilde;o G&oacute;mez, shared a sweet moment, both planting kisses on G&oacute;mez&rsquo;s growing belly.

